stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OFFLINE
    OFFLINE --> AVAILABLE : login / heartbeat
    AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : reserve_agent (optimistic lock)
    AVAILABLE --> PAUSED : supervisor pause
    RESERVED --> DIALING : call INITIATED by event worker
    RESERVED --> AVAILABLE : reservation expired (recovery worker)
    DIALING --> CONNECTED : ANSWERED event received
    DIALING --> AVAILABLE : FAILED / NO_ANSWER / BUSY event
    CONNECTED --> WRAP_UP : COMPLETED event
    WRAP_UP --> AVAILABLE : wrap-up timer expires
    PAUSED --> AVAILABLE : resume
    AVAILABLE --> OFFLINE : logout

    note right of RESERVED
        state_version incremented on reservation
        reservation_expires_at = now() + 30s
        RecoveryWorker releases stale reservations
    end note

    note right of DIALING
        current_call_id set
        agent.status synced by EventProcessor
        when call event arrives
    end note
